<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Implementation Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide all implementation details for reproducibility in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ KeyWorld: Key Frame Reasoning Enables Effective and Efficient World Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. For fine-tuning the frame interpolator, we find it suffers from gradient explosion when training for more than 1 epoch, and it converges well on the large dataset with 1 epoch.</p>
</div>
